+# Wire Format Policy
+
+Nothing is recorded. This repository has no recorded decision document (ADR, policy, or similar) that designates a single wire serialisation format for the project; the existing documentation (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/doc.md) only describes JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, ProtoBuf, and MsgPack as optional, interchangeable rendering/binding formats supported by the framework, without recording a decision that establishes one of them as the project's chosen wire format.
